			"Message": "chore(Maintain): Add argparse support and rerun Markdown formatter\n\nImport argparse into Maintain/Format/Markdown.py to accept command-line arguments, then apply the formatter to README.md. The resulting changes remove unnecessary blank lines immediately before closing </table> tags in several embedded Markdown tables, aligning them with the script's intended multi-line layout.",
